# - T puller fed by the left column chain: (-3,3) observer down watches the left dust (-3,2) ->
#   dust (-3,4) -> observer (-2,4) facing west -> repeater d2 (-1,4) on stone (-1,3) -> observer
#   (0,4) facing west watching the repeater (pulse merger: one 2 gt pulse) -> T puller (1,4).
